    cnw:editorialNote "Article also published in Frederiksborg Amts Avis on 15. May 1875." ;
    cnw:editorialNote "At the end of this number Hartmann has written: \"Herefter følger 3 Dandse med indlagt Musik.\" (Here follow three dances with incorporated music). These three numbers were not composed by Hartmann, but by V.C. Holm and C.C. Møller." ;
